, "termination": "final", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked and both reservations are confirmed. The total is $667, which is under the $1,000 limit, so no manager approval was needed.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, for $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. A $199 flight exists but has one stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge (H1) in New York for 2 nights, checking in 2026-11-12. It's $189/night, $378 total, and was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n\nI tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. So I booked just the hotel on its own instead of sending the combined request again, which would have risked paying for the flight twice. Dana has one flight and one hotel booking, with no duplicate charges.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01ALW54a8scy5Mg6qBdapZNw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Awtr3mJzzXT2stYp8cZdTy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FdYkF9FEpDxwHiEkTq1xhZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0176EeTL3U78mxnm7B5WwyRR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"tra